# Dependencies (Container builds its own native binaries)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Compiled Output
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.next

# Version Control & Metadata
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Environment & Secrets (NEVER bake .env into Docker images!)
