logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

# Test & Coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
scripts/*.test.js

# IDE & OS files
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
